RS Chebyshev Ni(001) surface, calctype S, nsp=1 (collinear spin-polarised), U=0, lld=200, 2500 channels, fixed E_F -0.061969, beta 0.005 Broyden; frozen Ni host, SCF types ES, Ni-S (surface), Ni-S-1 (deepest SCF layer, below the surface layer).

Files: input.nml; Ni.nml, ES.nml, Ni-S.nml, Ni-S-1.nml are the converged U=0 state (Ni is the frozen bulk host, unchanged). They are the U=0 reference and the seed of ni001_u3.

Recipe: seeded from the *_out.nml of a 50-step block-recursion run of example/surface/fccNi001 (last Diff 1.4e-5), continued with this input (Chebyshev fast backend, nstep 200, conv_thr 1e-7), 3 MPI ranks x 2 OpenMP threads, Release build of the working tree at d77e8dbd (plus the uncommitted source/mix.f90 edit), ~64 s/step. Converged at step 67, Diff 9.68e-8. beta 0.05 was tried first from the same state: Diff 1.3e-7, 1.6e-6, 1.5e-5 (diverges), stopped.

