Explicit U=J=0 in &hamiltonian does not enter the LDA+U path (hubbard_u_general_check needs U or J > 1e-10 Ry), so U=0 here is the plain LDA run. Wiring check of the surface U path as U->0 (reduced deck: nstep 1, lld 50, 500 channels, U on d of Ni, Ni-S, Ni-S-1, J=0, versus the same deck without U): etot shift of Ni-S 1.99e-7, 1.89e-6, 1.88e-5 Ry at U = 1e-4, 1e-3, 1e-2 eV (ratios 9.53, 9.95 per decade); Ni-S-1 1.46e-7, 1.61e-6, 1.61e-5 Ry. Wiring evidence only.
